meta {
  name: Member tags - Create
  type: http
  seq: 207
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/member-tags
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Founder",
    "color": "purple",
    "visibility": "members"
  }
}

docs {
  Creates a member tag (#1389): owner and admins. The name holds 2 to 32 characters on one line, its spaces are trimmed and made single, and it is unique in the community without the case. Without a color the tag is gray; without a visibility it is for the managers only. Returns 201 with the tag. A community has at most 100 tags (422 after that). Token ability: member-tags:write.
}
